{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_ttr_123_1","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_123","textTraditional":"【經】","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_ttr_123_2","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_123","textTraditional":"九年春王正月，公如齊。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_ttr_123_3","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_123","textTraditional":"公至自齊。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_ttr_123_4","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_123","textTraditional":"夏，仲孫蔑如京師。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_ttr_123_5","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_123","textTraditional":"齊侯伐萊。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_ttr_123_6","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_123","textTraditional":"秋，取根牟。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_ttr_123_7","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_123","textTraditional":"八月，滕子卒。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_ttr_123_8","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_123","textTraditional":"九月，晉侯、宋公、衛侯、鄭伯、曹伯會于扈。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_ttr_123_9","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_123","textTraditional":"晉荀林父帥師伐陳。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_ttr_123_10","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_123","textTraditional":"辛酉，晉侯黑臀卒于扈。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_ttr_123_11","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_123","textTraditional":"冬十月癸酉，衛侯鄭卒。","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_ttr_123_12","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_123","textTraditional":"宋人圍滕。","sentenceOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_ttr_123_13","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_123","textTraditional":"楚子伐鄭。","sentenceOrder":13},{"id":"s_work_ttr_123_14","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_123","textTraditional":"晉郤缺帥師救鄭。","sentenceOrder":14},{"id":"s_work_ttr_123_15","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_123","textTraditional":"陳殺其大夫洩冶。","sentenceOrder":15},{"id":"s_work_ttr_123_16","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_123","textTraditional":"【傳】","sentenceOrder":16},{"id":"s_work_ttr_123_17","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_123","textTraditional":"九年春，王使來徵聘。夏，孟獻子聘於周，王以為有禮，厚賄之。","sentenceOrder":17},{"id":"s_work_ttr_123_18","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_123","textTraditional":"秋，取根牟，言易也。","sentenceOrder":18},{"id":"s_work_ttr_123_19","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_123","textTraditional":"滕昭公卒。","sentenceOrder":19},{"id":"s_work_ttr_123_20","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_123","textTraditional":"會于扈，討不睦也。陳侯不會，晉荀林父以諸侯之師伐陳。晉侯卒于扈，乃還。","sentenceOrder":20},{"id":"s_work_ttr_123_21","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_123","textTraditional":"冬，宋人圍滕，因其喪也。","sentenceOrder":21},{"id":"s_work_ttr_123_22","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_123","textTraditional":"陳靈公與孔寧、儀行父通於夏姬，皆衷其衵服，以戲于朝。洩冶諫曰：「公卿宣淫，民無効焉！且聞不令，君其納之。」公曰：「吾能改矣。」公告二子，二子請殺之，公弗禁，遂殺洩冶。孔子曰：「《詩》云：『民之多辟，無自立辟。』其洩冶之謂乎。」","sentenceOrder":22},{"id":"s_work_ttr_123_23","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_123","textTraditional":"楚子為厲之役故，伐鄭。","sentenceOrder":23},{"id":"s_work_ttr_123_24","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_123","textTraditional":"晉郤缺救鄭，鄭伯敗楚師于柳棼。國人皆喜，唯子良憂曰：「是國之災也，吾死無日矣。」","sentenceOrder":24}],"overrides":{}}